      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "LinkedIn can be a useful resource whenever you're looking for a job, or looking to fill a job, and is a total waste of time the other 93% of the time. (All opinions my own, obviously.) I maintain "
          },
          {
            "attributes": [
              {
                "name": "href",
                "type": "mdxJsxAttribute",
                "value": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/preston-richey-40b35950/"
